        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>积分公式与特殊角三角函数值</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$'], ['\\\\(', '\\\\)']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$'], ['\\\\[', '\\\\]']]\n  },\n  svg: { fontCache: 'global' }\n};\n</script>\n<script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-svg.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    color: #222;\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n  }\n\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding-top: 10px;\n    background: #fff;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n\n  .formula-table {\n    width: 476px;\n    margin-left: 35px;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    table-layout: fixed;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n\n  .formula-table col:first-child {\n    width: 262px;\n  }\n\n  .formula-table col:last-child {\n    width: 214px;\n  }\n\n  .formula-table td {\n    border: 1px solid #aaa;\n    height: 32px;\n    padding: 2px 8px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .formula-table td:last-child {\n    padding-left: 0;\n    padding-right: 0;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .formula-table tr:last-child td {\n    height: 48px;\n  }\n\n  .notes {\n    width: 470px;\n    margin-left: 39px;\n    margin-top: 14px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n  }\n\n  .section-title {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .rule-block {\n    margin-top: 7px;\n  }\n\n  .rule-line {\n    height: 31px;\n    margin: 0;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .rule-line.indented {\n    padding-left: 11px;\n  }\n\n  .substitution-title {\n    margin-top: -1px;\n  }\n\n  .substitution-row {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 132px 132px 145px;\n    align-items: center;\n    width: 430px;\n    margin-top: 7px;\n    padding-left: 5px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .special-title {\n    margin-top: 7px;\n    margin-left: 4px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 11px;\n  }\n\n  .value-row {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 86px 89px 92px 99px 82px;\n    align-items: center;\n    width: 456px;\n    margin-left: 5px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    font-size: 11px;\n  }\n\n  .value-row.sin {\n    margin-top: 14px;\n  }\n\n  .value-row.cos {\n    margin-top: 25px;\n  }\n\n  .value-row.tan {\n    margin-top: 25px;\n  }\n\n  mjx-container {\n    margin: 0 !important;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <table class=\"formula-table\">\n    <colgroup>\n      <col>\n      <col>\n    </colgroup>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td>$\\int f(e^x)\\cdot e^x\\,dx=\\int f(e^x)d(e^x)$</td>\n        <td>$u=e^x$</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>$\\int f(a^x)\\cdot a^x\\,dx=\\dfrac{1}{\\ln a}\\int f(a^x)d(a^x)$</td>\n        <td>$u=a^x$</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>$\\int f(\\sin x)\\cdot\\cos x\\,dx=\\int f(\\sin x)d(\\sin x)$</td>\n        <td>$u=\\sin x$</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>$\\int f(\\cos x)\\cdot\\sin x\\,dx=-\\int f(\\cos x)d(\\cos x)$</td>\n        <td>$u=\\cos x$</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>$\\int f(\\tan x)\\cdot\\sec^2x\\,dx=\\int f(\\tan x)d(\\tan x)$</td>\n        <td>$u=\\tan x$</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>$\\int f(\\cot x)\\cdot\\csc^2x\\,dx=-\\int f(\\cot x)d(\\cot x)$</td>\n        <td>$u=\\cot x$</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>$\\int f(\\arctan x)\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{1+x^2}\\,dx=\\int f(\\arctan x)d(\\arctan x)$</td>\n        <td>$u=\\arctan x$</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>$\\int f(\\arcsin x)\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}\\,dx=\\int f(\\arcsin x)d(\\arcsin x)$</td>\n        <td>$u=\\arcsin x$</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n  <main class=\"notes\">\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">十、分部积分法公式</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"rule-block\">\n      <p class=\"rule-line\">(1)形如 $\\int x^n e^{ax}dx$，令 $u=x^n$，$dv=e^{ax}dx$</p>\n      <p class=\"rule-line indented\">形如 $\\int x^n\\sin xdx$，令 $u=x^n$，$dv=\\sin xdx$</p>\n      <p class=\"rule-line indented\">形如 $\\int x^n\\cos xdx$，令 $u=x^n$，$dv=\\cos xdx$</p>\n      <p class=\"rule-line\">(2)形如 $\\int x^n\\arctan xdx$，令 $u=\\arctan x$，$dv=x^ndx$</p>\n      <p class=\"rule-line indented\">形如 $\\int x^n\\ln xdx$，令 $u=\\ln x$，$dv=x^ndx$</p>\n      <p class=\"rule-line\">(3)形如 $\\int e^{ax}\\sin xdx$，$\\int e^{ax}\\cos xdx$令 $u=e^{ax},\\sin x,\\cos x$均可。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2 class=\"section-title substitution-title\">十一、第二换元积分法中的三角换元公式</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"substitution-row\">\n      <span>(1) $\\sqrt{a^2-x^2}$　$x=a\\sin t$</span>\n      <span>(2) $\\sqrt{a^2+x^2}$　$x=a\\tan t$</span>\n      <span>(3) $\\sqrt{x^2-a^2}$　$x=a\\sec t$</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"special-title\">【特殊角的三角函数值】</div>\n\n    <div class=\"value-row sin\">\n      <span>（1）$\\sin 0=0$</span>\n      <span>（2）$\\sin\\dfrac{\\pi}{6}=\\dfrac{1}{2}$</span>\n      <span>（3）$\\sin\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}$</span>\n      <span>（4）$\\sin\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}=1$</span>\n      <span>（5）$\\sin\\pi=0$</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"value-row cos\">\n      <span>（1）$\\cos 0=1$</span>\n      <span>（2）$\\cos\\dfrac{\\pi}{6}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}$</span>\n      <span>（3）$\\cos\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}=\\dfrac{1}{2}$</span>\n      <span>（4）$\\cos\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}=0$</span>\n      <span>（5）$\\cos\\pi=-1$</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"value-row tan\">\n      <span>（1）$\\tan 0=0$</span>\n      <span>（2）$\\tan\\dfrac{\\pi}{6}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{3}$</span>\n      <span>（3）$\\tan\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}=\\sqrt3$</span>\n      <span>（4）$\\tan\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}$不存在</span>\n      <span>（5）$\\tan\\pi=0$</span>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
